  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This allocation contributes to the UNICEF appeal &#x2018;humanitarian action for children&#x2019; in Ukraine for 2026. To address humanitarian needs related to winter and the energy situation, UNICEF is working with water, sanitation, heating, and critical social infrastructure, using alternative energy and heating solutions to ensure children&#x2019;s access to essential services.</narrative>
